{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106090","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910609001:1":{"text":"가네트에게 줄 물건을 가져올 테니 근처에서 쉬고 있어라. 소리는 절대 내면 안 된다.","source_cn":"我去给歌尼特取东西，你们可以在附近休息，但不要发出响声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CC7ADC5258E08DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910609002:1":{"text":"칼릭스, 여기가... 너희 집이야?","source_cn":"卡律先生，这里就是……你家？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2E4C37EBA611DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910609003:1":{"text":"타라사랑은 완전 딴판이네. 진짜 허름해.","source_cn":"和塔拉萨真是两副景象，真够简陋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01A9877E50E23013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910609004:1":{"text":"우리 일족은 원래 바위 동굴에서 산다. 게다가 이곳은 사람을 미치게 만드는 그 소리 때문에 오래전에 버려졌지...","source_cn":"我的族裔本就栖居岩洞，况且这里早被废弃了。呵，拜那种令...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B4830474AEEE9E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910609005:1":{"text":"근처에서 기다려라.","source_cn":"在附近等着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4554160403EC4155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen